WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.440
Escuchar.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.360
We did everything we could.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.840
Your grandfather suffered

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:10.720
a critical spike

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.520
in his blood pressure.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.160
I'm sorry.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.720
Leave me alone.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.320
Listen.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.640
It would’ve been better for you,

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.120
if you just step out.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.000
I said

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.400
leave me alone.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.920
It means I am not leaving.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.840
You are.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.560
Alright.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.080
Take your time.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:08.680
Why did you leave me?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.240
All alone...

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.760
Right now...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:13.680
Why?

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.920
Hey, that’s alright. It’s okay.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:26.720
It’s me.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.240
It's right here.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:31.960
Thank you, Anthony.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.960
You are a really good man.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.520
I'm sorry, but...

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:44.200
Now I just...

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.360
I would like to be alone for a little,

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.280
please.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.880
Sure.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:51.600
Okay.
